			"notes": "Minor update to bring the mod into 1.21.5\n\n## Changes\n- The offhand damage bonus is now dependent on item having a default `combat-plus:melee_weapon` component.\n- Parry and Lunge can obtain their damage from `combat-plus:melee_weapon` components if applicable. \n- Riposte and Deflection can no longer be put on items without Parry.\n- Thrusting and Forceful can no longer be put on items without Lunge.\n- Parry now grants a Blocks Attacks component to the item.\n\n## Removals\n- The following enchantment effects have been moved to Combat+ Core.\n  - Set Cooldown\n  - Max Use Time\n  - Modify Cooldown"
		},
